{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_17","type":"agent_message","text":"The core rules are in place: shared ring carrying, revival, distinct class actions, timed hazards, Dread, checkpoints, and seal-based victory. The procedural audio tests pass. Next I’m wiring the playable screens and controls, then testing full expeditions through ordinary inputs.\n"}}
