{"type":"item.started","item":{"id":"item_28","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"python3 - <<'PY'\nimport json,pathlib\np=pathlib.Path('exit-interview.json')\nx={'sourceInformation':{'date':'2026-11-06 03:18:49','source':'Quest for the Rings (1981), Odyssey²','plan':'PLAN.md','genre':'Cooperative fantasy action-adventure','perspective':'Fixed three-quarter ground view; shared camera','tech':'JavaScript, HTML/CSS, Canvas 2D; full my-3D2dge v0.89.1 (8ecc2f62353761187bdfe226f327b7ea5d2eb691); AI Hub session client 1.4.0 (35a1047f2067b2af3de3943f0fe452f39105d869). Self-contained; no runtime downloads.','artDirection':'Original shaded procedural pixel art: obsidian, gold, luminous crystal, furnaces and violet clockwork. Native shapes, materials, lights and contact shadows.','animation':'Native continuous volumetric Humanoid rigs and Attack wind-up/active/recovery timelines; original held poses and bespoke dragon/spider/Nightmare motion.','audio':'Original code-created Web Audio instruments through native ChipAudio; music, effects and captioned gibberish. Music defaults to 10%. No audio files.','online':'AI Hub shared-world authoritative co-op, 1–2 humans; server-only host supported. Standalone solo AI companion and couch co-op; no standalone online matchmaking.','testing':'Headless simulation, ordinary-action scripted campaigns, emitted HTML file launch, Chromium/WebKit/Firefox, emulated standard pads and phone/tablet touch, OfflineAudioContext, local-browser Hub harness. No physical controller, touch hardware, TV, second human or listener. Final results pending.','research':'Original manual transcript and scanned illustrated cover, heroes, monsters and gameplay pages at odyssey2.info; pinned engine handoff README/API/adventure/asset manual; pinned Hub protocol/session/harness. Original audio timbres and continuous score: unknown.','environment':'Codex CLI (headless); Linux Ubuntu 26.04 on WSL2','model':'OpenAI, gpt-6.1-sol, reasoning effort ultra','usage':'added on import'},'testingFeedback':['Verification in progress.','Verification in progress.','Ordinary-action whole-expedition checks, including all ten hero pairings.','No final comparison yet.'],'engineFeedback':['The native shaded skeletons, materials and lighting supply a coherent pixel-art base without external assets.','Camera and native shape-facing conventions required inspection and visual verification.','The shared deterministic expedition simulation, cooperative objectives and authoritative Hub adapter.','Keeping native rendering observational while dynamic geometry, safe phase exits and network checkpoints share the same rules.','None. The supplied full engine is unmodified; the game extends shapes, materials, patterns, poses, instruments, input, Shell and settings through native APIs.','Provide a small documented shared-world snapshot example alongside the adventure kit.'],'promptFeedback':['The source relationships and clear complete-expedition acceptance criteria.','The brief allows downloadable dependencies while the plan prefers an offline file; the shipped game includes all runtime code.','Integrating every input and authority lifecycle with the full cooperative expedition.','Separate measured first-play duration from required deterministic gameplay evidence and define a shorter minimum slice target.'],'aiHub':{'name':'Quest for the Fourfold Rings','tagline':'Steal the light. Bring each other home.','description':'Two differently gifted heroes steal four rings from stone, crystal, fire and shifting halls while the Ringmaster changes the road. Play with an AI companion, couch co-op, or AI Hub shared-world online co-op, then bind an undying dragon and escape together.','type':'Game','genre':'Adventure','source':'Quest for the Rings (1981)','series':'','players':'1–2','controls':'Move WASD/left stick; aim mouse/right stick; primary left click/R2; class right click/L2; dodge Space/Cross; context E/Triangle (hold revive/pass); companion Q/R1; objective Tab/Square; pause Esc/Options. Touch assisted sticks/actions. Couch keyboard+pad or two pads; AI Hub online.','tags':['co-op','fantasy','pixel art','exploration','boss fights','retro']}}\np.write_text(json.dumps(x,indent=2,ensure_ascii=False)+'\\\\n')\nPY\nnode Quest-for-the-Fourfold-Rings-Quest-for-the-Rings-gpt-6.1-sol-ultra-20261106-031849/tools/build.mjs\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
