{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_41","type":"agent_message","text":"The emitted HTML now launches through title, hero selection, and the courtyard. Initial ordinary-input tests complete the expedition with every hero pairing. Testing also found two simulation bugs—reused event IDs after Continue and a Ringmaster event that failed to move a wall—which I’m fixing before broader browser and network checks.\n"}}
