{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_57","type":"agent_message","text":"The Hub harness passes all six required scenarios. A separate server-only session test also passes real damage, ring pickup and passing, revive, and room progression across two clients. I’ve tightened extraction so the carrier must reach the exit, and the finale requires living heroes to escape together. Device controls, reconnect behavior, and presentation are still under test.\n"}}
